	<h1>The Open Ops Manual</h1>
	<p>
		<strong>Mission:</strong> Disintermediation—Removing the parasitic middlemen from digital and physical infrastructure to empower community sovereignty.
	</p>
	<p>
		At Punk Positronics, we believe that the process of building a business should be as open as the software we use to run it. This is our "Open Ops" commitment: we document our struggles, our wins, and our systems in real-time.
	</p>
	<p>
		By open-sourcing the "How-To" of our operations, we aim to build trust and attract a tribe of like-minded creators and entrepreneurs who want to reclaim sovereignty over their own infrastructure.
	</p>
	<h2>Our Core Ethos</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Open, Honest, Planet-First:</strong> A man, not a corporation.</li>
		<li><strong>Themes:</strong> FOSS, SolarPunk, Maker Culture, Upcycling, and DIY.</li>
		<li><strong>Radical Transparency:</strong> If we find a better way to do things, we share it.</li>
